    "Poll interval 2 ms; observed first-result time is an upper bound on availability.",
    "Every final answer and every first observed prefix matches independent Python integer/Decimal arithmetic.",
    "Progressive partials describe only committed fragments in reported coverage; they are not population estimates.",
    "Final cost includes all checkpoints, including unused old revisions."
  ]
}
